{# 居中头部：EN 眉标 · 宋体重标题（强调词陶土橙）· 副题 · 细线中断短划 #}
<div class="m-head">
  {% if d.eyebrow %}<div data-ppt="text" class="m-kicker">{{ d.eyebrow }}</div>{% endif %}
  <div class="m-title-row">
    {% for seg in d.title|marksplit %}
    <div data-ppt="text" class="m-title"{% if seg.mark %} style="color:{{ colors['accent'] }};"{% endif %}>{{ seg.text }}</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if d.subtitle is defined and d.subtitle %}<div data-ppt="text" class="m-sub">{{ d.subtitle }}</div>{% endif %}
  <div class="m-div">
    <div data-ppt="rect" class="m-div-line"></div>
    <div data-ppt="rect" class="m-div-dash"></div>
    <div data-ppt="rect" class="m-div-line"></div>
  </div>
</div>
